0,000+ word script!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater Puzzles:</strong>\u00a0Take on challenges from the gods, navigate ancient technology, and solve the Siren Seal's as you discover the mechanism's of an primordial enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Keena rise above the waves of darkness, or will the ocean\u2019s final light fade forever? Find out in <i>Miuratale</i>.</p>","developers":["Carrion Wave LLC","Studio Nemi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334250/header.jpg?t=1754022236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2334250/858517/9fef50e8fe29530f8b27b54d1b1dbbe795901960/1750907714/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743048683","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2334250/858517/9fef50e8fe29530f8b27b54d1b1dbbe795901960/1750907714/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743048683","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2334250/858517/9fef50e8fe29530f8b27b54d1b1dbbe795901960/1750907714/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743048683","id":257118985,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118985/movie480.mp4?t=1743048683","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118985/movie_max.mp4?t=1743048683"},"name":"Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118985/5fa413e7ede49e0b91fba03f3ed424882334e58e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743048683","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118985/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743048683","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118985/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743048683